    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"choosing to stop hurting\"... i've never thought about it like that. it sounds so peaceful. just to not have to wake up to the same nightmare every morning. it feels like the only way to actually get some rest would be to just... exit. do you really think it's okay to feel like that? like, is it actually a valid choice to just want it all to be over?",
